{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01259","headline":"相和歌辞 雁门太守行 · 庄南杰","name":"相和歌辞 雁门太守行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌旗闪闪摇天末，长笛横吹虏尘阔。\n跨下嘶风白练狞，腰间切玉青蛇活。\n击革摐金燧牛尾，犬羊兵败如山死。\n九泉寂寞葬秋虫，湿云荒草啼秋思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}